OL,3,GNEWSA'The end of an emotional journey
OL,4,Afor our colleague'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition signed by more than one
OL,7,Fmillion people opposing the early
OL,8,Frelease of PC Andrew Harper's killers
OL,9,Fhas been delivered to Downing Street.
OL,11,FHarper, from Wallingford, Oxfordshire,
OL,12,Fdied in August 2019 when the Thames
OL,13,FValley Police (TVP) officer was dragged
OL,14,Fby a car as three teenagers, including
OL,15,FAlbert Bowers and Jessie Cole, fled a
OL,16,Fquad bike theft in Berkshire.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
