OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'The end of an emotional journey
OL,4,Afor our colleague'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBower and Cole had been eligible for
OL,7,Fearly release, but on Sunday the Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham announced they
OL,9,Fwould remain behind bars, following
OL,10,Fmonths of campaigning from PC Harper's
OL,11,Ffamily and former colleagues.
OL,13,FTVP Federation Chair Aileen O'Connor,
OL,14,Fwho presented the petition to the
OL,15,Fgovernment, said it was an "emotional
OL,16,Fmoment".
